; Two pads of one account on one day: the one on the later line pads, whatever their
; `time`, as beancount orders the pads of a day by their line. The other is unused.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 open Assets:A
1970-01-01 open Equity:X
1970-01-01 open Equity:Y

2024-01-05 pad Assets:A Equity:X
  time: "15:30:00"
2024-01-05 pad Assets:A Equity:Y
  time: "12:00:00"
2024-01-06 balance Assets:A  100 CNY
